Implement support for C++ User Defined Literals in the Sphinx C++ domain. The current implementation fails when processing code such as:

  namespace units::si {
    inline constexpr auto planck_constant = 6.62607015e-34q_J * 1q_s;
  }

This produces an error: 'WARNING: Invalid definition: Expected end of definition.' As indicated by the Sphinx reference, the parser does not currently handle UDLs. The fix should enable Sphinx to recognize and correctly process user defined literal suffixes.
